{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 68225, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 49428, "uid": 63226, "type": 4, "title": "木wb点火队攻略（4.04E完结）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1611854095, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1612365166, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 25, "status": 1, "summary": "4E达成毕业~~~参考阵容1、魂卡：新卡比老卡强10%。2、主刀：火伞>情人勒达>红龙（上图伤害红龙是吃不到应援的所以基本上137：125：100比较符合实际）技能预设：火伞TSSSS，勒达S，红龙S", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612365164623_75388683.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 5, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 10502, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 68225, "content": "<div>4E达成毕业~~~</div><div><span><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">参考阵容</div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612365164623_75388683.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612365164623_75388683.jpg\"></div></span><br></div></span><br></div></span><br></div></span><br></div></span><br></div></span></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br></div></span></div></span></div><div><br></div><div>1、魂卡：新卡比老卡强10%。</div><div>2、主刀：火伞 &gt; 情人勒达 &gt; 红龙 （上图伤害红龙是吃不到应援的所以基本上137：125：100比较符合实际）</div><div>技能预设：火伞TSSSS，勒达S，红龙S</div><div>注意：勒达无需设置T</div><div>3、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">攻击微调</span>：遵循2个原则，2回合的加攻辅助（入金币、木莫娜）确保退出攻击前9，丢前排，不要吃-2S的糖猫buff；其他火系SS输出保持攻击前9丢后排，进行一些输出。</div><div>4、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">预设时序</span>：人鱼和梅芙的T负责给三刀充能，但是注意梅芙的加速buff比人鱼弱，不要都设STTTT，请错开，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">如人鱼TSTTT，梅芙STTTT，同时两者要么都是火系前五攻击同吃人鱼加速，要么一起滚出前五，以便时序同步</span>。</div><div>5、其他预设：金币STTTT，水鲸TSSSS</div><div>6、DS：如果单独测试，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">火莫娜能稳定提升分数10~20%</span>；<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">鲜花、光月月是没什么鸟用的+0%</span>，鲜花本来能有一点加速优势，可以多放一个火莫娜，但是经常进DS，对于三把刀的暴击状态不是什么好事情；<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">木莫娜容易导致攻击乱序且也没什么用，木人鱼因为DS加成比SS buff低会导致分数下降-5%~10%</span>。综上火莫娜必备，其他真的随意，而且金币ds加攻比圣诞勒达少，双循环也不行，所以只有 X+火莫娜+金币可行，至于X是啥对分数影响不大。这段说的是点火后的情况，因为这些debuffer的DS加值都比点火的SS低，未点火请勿对号入座！</div><div><br></div><div><span><div class=\"div-img\">可替换的：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">1、火神盾可换火弓，各有优劣</div><div class=\"div-img\">2、仓鼠可换金星，我上金星是因为金星锁人，我把木莫娜作为木一攻，金星帮助木莫娜稳定蜂鸟效果。</div><div class=\"div-img\">3、金币没有P的可以换下位泡面，但是金币有活动加成</div><div class=\"div-img\">4、圣诞勒达下位是鲜花奶、没有点火的水泡盾</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">队长</div><div class=\"div-img\">对策刀，没试过别的了</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">装备情况：</div><div class=\"div-img\">三把刀附魔 SS T0 温泉52~72级</div><div class=\"div-img\">火伞勒达新魂卡，魔龙、火莫娜老魂卡，点火石：都是红攻红爆白攻</div><div class=\"div-img\">buff满时候火伞伤害118W*6，勒达105W*6，魔龙85W*6</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">点火石如果都是三红、温泉泡满估计能4亿，但是这次应该冲不上了。</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-in